linked-accounts-select = Mailbox account
linked-accounts-primary = Primary
linked-accounts-unavailable = Unavailable
linked-accounts-manage = Manage linked mailboxes
linked-accounts-title = Linked mailboxes
linked-accounts-description = Access another mailbox while keeping your primary sign-in. Each mailbox keeps its own preferences, identities, signatures, folders, and drafts.
linked-accounts-add = Link a mailbox
linked-accounts-address = Username or email address
linked-accounts-password = Password
linked-accounts-name = Display name (optional)
linked-accounts-verify-help = Verify the mailbox credentials. If this account requires a second factor, complete it in the next step. Your primary sign-in stays unchanged.
linked-accounts-fields-required = Enter a username and password. Keep the optional display name under 129 characters.
linked-accounts-submit = Verify and link
linked-accounts-cancel = Cancel
linked-accounts-disabled = Linking mailboxes is disabled by your account policy.
linked-accounts-limit = You have reached the maximum number of linked mailboxes allowed by policy.
linked-accounts-reauth = Access expired. Unlink this mailbox, then link it again to sign in.
linked-accounts-unlink = Unlink mailbox
linked-accounts-unlink-confirm = Confirm unlink
linked-accounts-open = Open mailbox
linked-accounts-unlink-help = This removes access through your primary account. It does not delete the mailbox or its messages.
linked-accounts-switch-failed = The mailbox could not be opened. Your previous mailbox has not been silently substituted.
linked-accounts-changed = Your sign-in changed. Reopen linked mailboxes before continuing.
linked-accounts-refresh-help = Live updates are unavailable for linked mailboxes. Refresh to check for new messages.
linked-accounts-factor-title = Verify this mailbox
linked-accounts-factor-help = Complete the linked mailbox’s second factor. This does not change your primary sign-in.
linked-accounts-error = The mailbox request could not be completed. Try again after checking your account and connection.
linked-accounts-enrollment-required = Set up the required second factor by signing in to that mailbox separately, then try linking it again.
linked-accounts-password-change-required = Change this mailbox’s password through its own sign-in, then try linking it again.
linked-accounts-challenge-expired = Verification expired. Start linking the mailbox again.
linked-accounts-use = Use linked mailboxes
linked-accounts-use-help = Allow access to your linked mailboxes when your administrator permits it. Turning this off does not delete the links or their mailboxes.
linked-accounts-primary-preference = Switch to your primary account to change this preference.
linked-accounts-backend-unsupported = Linked mailboxes currently support verified native IMAP, POP3, and EWS accounts. Proxy and SSO accounts are not supported.
linked-accounts-verification-required = Complete the sign-in verification, then try again.
linked-accounts-retry = Retry
